@startuml Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0BB
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0BB"

**Interfaces Legend**
   //ri140 //: DCM DataServices
   
endlegend

note top of EC
DID E0BB Handler is responsible for managing MAC Verification Per Key Slot information.
It provides current status (passing, indeterminate, failed, unused) for each configured key slot,
including Transmitter DTC, Status, and Fail Timer. Data is persisted to NvM for accumulation
across ignition cycles.
end note

interface "DCM DataServices" as ri140

component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0BB] as EC {
	component [Sum_Ssfm_DID_E0BB] as E
}

ri140 -down-> EC



@enduml
